60304084450/http://www.blm.gov/or/oregontrail/history-basics.php" class="external text" id="mwAZQ">"Basic Facts about the Oregon Trail"</a>. <i id="mwAZU">National Historic Oregon Trail Interpretive Center</i>. United States Department of the Interior Bureau of Land Management. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.blm.gov/or/oregontrail/history-basics.php" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="http://www.blm.gov/or/oregontrail/history-basics.php" id="mwAZY">the original</a> on March 4, 2016<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwAZc">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwAZg">February 11,</span> 2016</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=National+Historic+Oregon+Trail+Interpretive+Center&amp;rft.atitle=Basic+Facts+about+the+Oregon+Trail&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.blm.gov%2For%2Foregontrail%2Fhistory-basics.php&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fsimple.wikipedia.org%3AOregon+Trail" class="Z3988" about="#mwt50" id="mwAZk"></span></span></li>
